    "ja": "黒影夜子の駐在日誌"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Meet the cool new police officer assigned to a rural village! The police officer, Yako Kurokage, is weak in strength, lacks stamina, eats too little, and she is afraid to stand the sun... Chizuru Oshida, a high school girl who lives across the street, can't help but worry about her...?",
   "ja": "ド田舎の村に、かっこよ(わ)い駐在さんが赴任してきました!? 駐在警察官・黒影夜子は、力がない、体力もない、食も細い。そして、太陽に弱い……。向かいの家に住む女子高生・忍田千鶴はそんな彼女を放っておけなく…?"
  },
